"""
Day Manager - Active Position Management
=========================================
Runs during market hours (9:30 AM - 4:00 PM ET)
Actively manages positions with ~1 minute refresh cycle.

Features:
- Monitors all positions in real-time
- Calculates position health scores
- Replaces weak positions with better candidates
- Uses exposure/cash/failsafe limits for entry control
- Cleans up duplicate/orphan orders
- Logs all activity

Usage:
  python -m autotrade.core.day_manager              # Dry run (no trades)
  python -m autotrade.core.day_manager --execute    # Live trading
  python -m autotrade.core.day_manager --test       # Run one cycle and exit
"""

